lshape3d_hex.out
3D L-shaped beam (hexahedra) - adaptive linear static analysis with Gmsh remeshing
adaptlinearstatic nsteps 1 adapt 1 maxadaptsteps 3 meshpackage 4 eetype 1 normtype 1 requirederror 0.10 minelemsize 0.02 gmshgeo "lshape3d.geo" gmshctrl "lshape3d_hex.ctrl" gmshopts "--elemtype hex" profileopt 1 nmodules 1
vtkxml tstep_all domain_all primvars 1 1 cellvars 1 1
domain 3d
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 2 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 3
SimpleCS 1 material 1 set 1
IsoLE 1 E 210.e3 n 0.3 d 1.0 talpha 0.0
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 3 values 3 0.0 0.0 0.0 set 2
ConstantSurfaceLoad 2 loadTimeFunction 1 loadtype 3 dofs 3 1 2 3 Components 3 0.0 -1.0 0.0 set 3
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.0
Set 1 elements
Set 2 nodes
Set 3 elementboundaries

# Gmsh physical groups -> oofem properties
# (gmsh UNV element types: 115 linear hexahedron, 94 linear quadrilateral)
group Domain
elemprop set 1
etype[115] LSpace

group Clamped
nodeprop set 2

group Load
elemprop set 3
etype[94]

